msgid ""
"MOVEJ if this controller is standalone; on mixed OCS2/WBC stacks `3` "
"means **OCS2**"
msgstr "本控制器独立运行时为 MOVEJ；在混合 OCS2/WBC 栈上 `3` 表示 **OCS2**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:56
#: d952189dc8de4a0ea37e5355b47b92e8
msgid ""
"MOVEJ returns only to HOLD (`2`). Full table and home-config `100`+ "
"commands: [basic_joint_controller "
"reference](../../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)."
msgstr ""
"MOVEJ 只能回到 HOLD（`2`）。完整表与 home 构型 `100`+ 命令见 [basic_joint_controller "
"参考](../../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md:58
